    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61142" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύτταρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cell of a honeycomb</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>V.</u>
				1111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				551b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				554a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				555a1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> pit in the
			receptacle of <i>Nelumbium speciosum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.8.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> male flower
			of the pine, ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.7.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχῖνος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111.1
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν δρυῶν οἱ κ.</span>, <i><span class="en">
