			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐρανοῦ τὸν κ.</span> the <i>pinnacle of
				the dome</i> of heaven, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				199
			</span></i>.</div>
